Description: Pure-R implementation of STABL for sparse and reliable biomarker
    discovery. Provides glmnet-based stability selection, FDP+ thresholding,
    artificial-feature controls, grouped bootstrapping, multi-omic early,
    late, and cooperative fusion workflows, visualization helpers, and
    export utilities without a Python or tidymodels runtime dependency.
    Cite the original STABL method (Hédou et al., Nat Biotechnol 2024) when
    reporting stability-selection results; cite this package for the R software.
